Byte computations (ruling 5):
- mode bits [7:6]: immediate 00 (0x00), calc 01 (0x40), move 10 (0x80), jump 11 (0xC0).
- loadi|N: N.
- calc op in [5:3]: add 0 → 0x40; sub 1 → 0x48; and 2 → 0x50; or 3 → 0x58; nand 4 → 0x60; nor 5 → 0x68.
- move src [5:3], dst [2:0]:
  - s0,d2 → 0x80 | 0x00 | 0x02 = 0x82
  - s3,d1 → 0x80 | 0x18 | 0x01 = 0x99
  - inp(6),d1 → 0x80 | 0x30 | 0x01 = 0xB1
  - s3,out(7) → 0x80 | 0x18 | 0x07 = 0x9F
  - inp,out → 0x80 | 0x30 | 0x07 = 0xB7
- jump cond [5:3]: j 0 → 0xC0; jz 1 → 0xC8; jnz 2 → 0xD0.

Countdown program: [0x01, 0x82, 0x40, 0x99, 0x02, 0xD0], labels {loop:2}.

